🔥 When Pull Model Is Useful
✅ 1. Different observers need different data
    Email → needs email + orderId
    Warehouse → needs items
    Analytics → needs everything
✅ 2. Avoid sending too much data
    Push → may over-send ❌
    Pull → observer decides ✅

⚠️ Trade-offs
❌ Tighter coupling
    Observer now depends on Subject
❌ Harder to understand flow
❌ Risk of multiple data calls
